# Night-sky emission lines for gist_prep.py (sky = model): 2098 lines, 3000-10000 A.
# Extracted from the high-resolution (R ~ 35000) Paranal night-sky spectrum distributed
# with PypeIt (pypeit/data/sky_spec/paranal_sky.fits, BSD-3 licence; vacuum wavelengths):
# continuum = smoothed running minimum; every emission peak integrated between its
# neighbouring minima (+-1 A at most); kept if its flux is >= 0.2% of [OI] 5577.
# Mostly OH Meinel bands, plus [OI] 5577/6300/6364, Na D and O2. Relative strengths vary
# with site, time of night and season: treat them as indicative.
